\AHow\ to\ Obtain\ Guild\ Funds:
(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Guild\ Funds\ are\ extremely\ important\ and\ will\ be\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})used\ to\ purchase\ essential\ Currency\ and\ items,\ such\ as\ Guild\ Supplies,\ in\ Guild\ Territory\ War(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.During\ Guild\ Caravan,\ Guild\ Members\ can\ earn\ Guild\ Funds\ by\ submitting\ requested\ items\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Completing\ a\ full\ round\ of\ caravan\ item\ requests\ grants\ a\ large\ amount\ of\ Guild\ Funds\.\z

\AHow\ to\ Earn\ Guild\ Contribution:
(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ Guild\ Contribution\ can\ be\ used\ to\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})upgrade\ Guild\ Buildings\.\ Higher\-level\ Guild\ Buildings\ unlock\ more\ Guild\ Benefits(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ Guild\ Members\ earn\ Weekly\ Guild\ Activity,\ Guild\ Contribution,\ and\ Personal\ Contribution\ by\ completing\ Guild\ Quests\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ Personal\ Contribution\ can\ be\ exchanged\ for\ items\ in\ the\ Guild\ Shop\ and\ will\ not\ be\ cleared\ when\ leaving\ the\ guild\.\z

\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Guild\ War\ Technology(?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ applies\ to\ Territory\ War(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ More\ effects\ gradually\ unlock\ with\ each\ Guild\ Institute\ Level\ Increased\ milestone\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.War\ Technology\ resets\ every\ Season\.\ At\ the\ start\ of\ a\ new\ Season,\ Guild\ Supplies\ must\ be\ spent\ on\ Level\-up\ again\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.During\ Stronghold\ Battles,\ Convoy\ Escort\ Battles,\ and\ Siege\ Battles,\ War\ Technology\ affects\ the\ stats\ of\ every\ Guild\ Member\.\z

\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Guild\ Limited\-Time\ Tactics\ provide\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})more\ powerful\ temporary\ effects\ in\ Territory\ War(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Authorized\ management\ Members\ can\ spend\ Guild\ Supplies\ to\ activate\ and\ refresh\ Tactics\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Limited\-Time\ Tactics\ automatically\ refresh\ once\ each\ day\ at\ 5:00\ a\.m\.\ The\ number\ of\ Tactics\ that\ can\ be\ drawn\ each\ day\ also\ resets\ at\ 5:00\ a\.m\.
(?<p5>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.(?<s6>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})The\ Limited\-Time\ Tactics\ pool\ unlocks\ as\ the\ Season\ progresses(?<s7>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ Higher\-quality,\ more\ powerful\ Tactics\ will\ become\ available\ later\ in\ the\ Season\.
(?<p8>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.The\ Tactics\ your\ Guild\ can\ have\ active\ are\ limited\ by\ points\.\ If\ you\ have\ reached\ the\ point\ limit,\ you\ must\ unequip\ a\ Tactic\ before\ activating\ another\ one\.
(?<p9>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Unequipping\ a\ Tactic\ will\ not\ refund\ the\ Guild\ Supplies\ spent\ to\ activate\ it\.
(?<p10>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.(?<s11>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})A\ Limited\-Time\ Tactic's\ timer\ starts\ as\ soon\ as\ it\ is\ activated(?<s12>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ When\ its\ remaining\ duration\ reaches\ (?<p13>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3}),\ it\ will\ be\ removed\ from\ Current\ Effect\.\z

\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Adventurers\ without\ a\ guild\ can\ Create\ Guilds\ or\ respond\ to\ and\ Join\ any\ guild\.
(?<p1>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.After\ initiating\ guild\ creation,\ 2\ other\ players\ must\ respond\ before\ the\ guild\ can\ be\ created\.\ If\ there\ are\ not\ enough\ Responses\ within\ (?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\ hours(?<s4>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6}),\ guild\ creation\ will\ fail\.
(?<p5>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Once\ the\ required\ number\ of\ Responses\ is\ reached,\ Guild\ Creation\ Successful\.\ After\ the\ guild\ is\ created,\ (?<s6>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})the\ creator\ automatically\ becomes\ the\ Guild\ Master\.(?<s7>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})
(?<p8>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.If\ guild\ creation\ fails,\ the\ items\ consumed\ to\ Create\ Guild\ will\ be\ Returned\ by\ mail\.
(?<p9>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.You\ must\ Join\ a\ guild\ to\ participate\ in\ Guild\ Activities\ and\ earn\ generous\ rewards\ and\ Event\ Auction\ Dividends\.
(?<p10>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Each\ Adventurer\ may\ have\ membership\ Requests\ pending\ with\ up\ to\ (?<s11>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})(?<p12>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\ guilds\ at\ once(?<s13>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ and\ may\ withdraw\ them\ at\ any\ time\.\z

\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.A\ Member\ with\ rally\ permissions\ can\ send\ a\ Guild\ Rally\ pop\-up\ to\ every\ Guild\ Member\.
(?<p1>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.After\ accepting\ the\ rally,\ Guild\ Members\ will\ immediately\ be\ teleported\ to\ the\ initiating\ Member's\ location\.
(?<p2>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.The\ (?<s3>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})Guild\ Rally\ Cooldown\ is\ (?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\ minutes(?<s5>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ and\ is\ shared\ by\ the\ entire\ guild\.\z

\AReceive\ an\ invite\ Rules:
(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Receiving\ a\ merge\ invite\ means\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})the\ other\ guild\ is\ inviting\ your\ guild\ to\ Merge\ into\ theirs(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.After\ accepting\ the\ merge\ invite,\ you\ must\ adjust\ the\ number\ of\ guild\ members\ who\ can\ Merge\ into\ the\ other\ guild\ so\ that\ it\ does\ not\ exceed\ the\ number\ of\ members\ they\ can\ accept\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Once\ you\ have\ accepted\ the\ merge\ invite\ and\ adjusted\ the\ number\ of\ members\ who\ can\ merge,\ (?<s5>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})the\ Merge\ Guild\ process\ will\ be\ completed\ at\ 5:00\ a\.m\.\ the\ next\ day(?<s6>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p7>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Before\ the\ merge\ takes\ place,\ you\ can\ select\ (?:【Cancel\ Merge】|\[ ?Cancel\ Merge ?\])\ on\ the\ screen\.\ The\ Merge\ Guild\ process\ will\ end\ immediately\ after\ it\ is\ canceled\.
(?<p8>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.If\ your\ guild's\ member\ count\ exceeds\ the\ number\ of\ members\ the\ other\ guild\ can\ accept\ when\ the\ merge\ takes\ place,\ the\ Merge\ Guild\ process\ will\ end\ immediately\ and\ the\ merge\ will\ fail\.
(?<p9>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.If\ the\ merge\ fails,\ neither\ guild\ will\ be\ changed\ or\ otherwise\ affected\.\z

\ASend\ an\ Invite:\ Rules
(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Sending\ a\ merge\ invite\ means\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})your\ guild\ is\ inviting\ the\ other\ guild\ to\ Merge\ into\ your\ guild(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.After\ you\ send\ a\ merge\ invite,\ the\ merge\ process\ will\ begin\ once\ the\ other\ guild\ agrees\ and\ adjusts\ the\ number\ of\ members\ who\ will\ Merge\ into\ your\ guild\ so\ that\ it\ does\ not\ exceed\ your\ guild's\ available\ capacity\.
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.The\ merge\ will\ be\ officially\ completed\ (?<s5>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})at\ 5:00\ AM\ the\ following\ day(?<s6>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ If\ the\ other\ guild\ has\ more\ members\ to\ merge\ than\ your\ guild\ can\ accept\ when\ the\ merge\ occurs,\ the\ merge\ will\ fail\.
(?<p7>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.If\ the\ merge\ fails,\ neither\ guild\ will\ undergo\ any\ changes\ or\ be\ affected\ in\ any\ way\.\z

\AGuild\ Activity\ Rules:
(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Any\ Guild\ Member\ who\ participates\ in\ a\ Guild\ Event\ Quest\ can\ earn(?<s1>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ Guild\ Activity,\ Guild\ Contribution,\ and\ Personal\ Contribution\ rewards(?<s2>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Guild\ Activity\ progress\ is\ shared\ by(?<s4>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ all\ Guild\ Members\ and\ resets\ every\ Monday\ at\ 5:00\ AM(?<s5>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ Any\ unclaimed\ Activity\ Chests\ will\ expire\.
(?<p6>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Guild\ Contribution\ is\ the\ Guild's\ Currency\ and\ can\ be\ used\ for\ building\ Level\-ups\.\ Personal\ Contribution\ is\ personal\ Currency\ that\ can\ be\ exchanged\ for\ items\ in\ the\ Guild\ Shop\.\z

\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.During\ the\ listing\ and\ auction\ periods,\ you\ can\ Pre\-purchase\ or\ bid\ on\ multiple\ Auction\ House\ items\ at\ once;
(?<p1>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.When\ the\ auction\ officially\ begins,\ Pre\-purchase\ searches\ all\ listings\ for\ the\ lowest\-priced\ batch\ of\ items\ and\ initiates\ batch\ Auto\-Bid;
(?<p2>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.The\ full\ Pre\-purchase\ price\ will\ be\ deducted\ from\ your\ Currency\ upfront\.\ If\ canceled\ or\ outbid,\ the\ Currency\ will\ be\ returned\ by\ mail;
(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.Because\ Pre\-purchase\ searches\ for\ the\ lowest\-priced\ listings\ available,\ you\ may\ initiate\ Auto\-Bid\ on\ the\ same\ item\ as\ another\ player\.\ Please\ keep\ this\ in\ mind\.\z

column3:
${p0}.ระหว่างช่วงลงรายการและประมูล ซื้อล่วงหน้าหรือเสนอราคาไอเทมหลายรายการในโรงประมูลพร้อมกันได้;
${p1}.เมื่อประมูลเริ่มอย่างเป็นทางการ ระบบซื้อล่วงหน้าค้นหารายการทั้งหมดเพื่อหาไอเทมกลุ่มที่ราคาต่ำที่สุด และเริ่มเสนอราคาอัตโนมัติหลายรายการ;
${p2}.หักราคาซื้อล่วงหน้าทั้งหมดจากสกุลเงินของคุณก่อน หากยกเลิกหรือมีผู้เสนอสูงกว่า จะคืนสกุลเงินทางจดหมาย;
${p3}.ระบบซื้อล่วงหน้าค้นหารายการราคาต่ำสุด จึงอาจเริ่มเสนอราคาอัตโนมัติไอเทมเดียวกับผู้เล่นอื่น โปรดคำนึงถึงเรื่องนี้

