\A(?<p0>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ When\ speaking\ freely\ in\ a\ Tavern\ room,\ please\ remember\ to\ (?<s1>(?:<[^<>
