(?<p3>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ Tavern\ chat\ will\ Keep\ its\ relatively\ strict\ moderation\ and\ reporting\ systems\.\ Adventurers,\ please\ do\ not\ post\ any\ content\ that\ violates\ the\ rules\.\ 
(?<p4>[+-]?[0-9]{1,12}(?:[.,][0-9]{1,12}){0,3})\.\ When\ you\ (?<s5>(?:<[^<>
