]{1,120}>){0,6})Note\ Clues(?<s3>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\ are\ scattered\ throughout\ a\ certain\ city\ each\ day\.\ Obtain\ a\ Clue\ to\ reveal\ the\ answer\ to\ its\ corresponding\ note\ puzzle\.\ Some\ Clues\ can\ be\ obtained\ from\ a\ mysterious\ person\.
The\ melody\ can\ only\ be\ played\ successfully\ when\ (?<s4>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})all\ notes\ are\ selected\ correctly(?<s5>(?:<[^<>
]{1,120}>){0,6})\.\ Search\ for\ Note\ Clues\ to\ uncover\ more\ answers!\z

